    "body": "There should be the ability for someone to delete their account, and remove all personal data about themselves from your server. Preferably a button on the \"edit profile\" page, but if not, there should be a published method of how to inform the administrators of the system to request this.\r\n\r\nI think this is different to https://github.com/DMPRoadmap/roadmap/issues/243, which looks like it requests the ability to disable an account, not delete it.",
